    "48 passing Node/Vitest tests: 14 vehicle/catalog/pose/transaction tests, 17 routed-consist/turnout tests and 17 scalar-motion tests. This manifest supplies unit evidence; actual visual evidence is separate.",
    "Rigid chord spacing, independent axle rail frames, articulated fixed-length stems/link, supported 100 mm curves and transitioned S curves, whole-consist turnout retention, stopped reversal, save/restore and per-axle phase are covered. Phase deltas are independently compared with route cursor stations through curvature changes.",
